  "ruleText": "Pes 103.01 Information Requests. Requests for, and providing information shall be according to the provisions of Agr 104.\n\nSource. #150, eff 1-9-74; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6239, eff 5-2-96\n\nAppendix",
